(text "Video RAM  $80:0000-$80:7FFF  (32 KB),\nselected by A23 alone." (at 309.88 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3a67abf6-eb15-52c1-b3e3-4097b4dfbbea))
(text "~{OEGATE} and ~{WEGATE} are shared by all three memories; the chip enables\nare mutually exclusive, so at most one device drives D0-D7 (decode.pld NOTE 1).\n~{WEGATE} includes PHI2, so no write can happen while D0-D7 carries the bank byte." (at 58.42 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 737d073f-f52f-598f-b7ff-7fb16b16b3e3))
